            "text": " to start each piece."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "attrs": {
          "level": 2
        },
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Head"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "24-round sphere, 9 cm diameter. Fit 12 mm amber or yellow safety eyes between rounds 9 and 10. Embroider a snarling muzzle in black thread. Stuff firmly."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "attrs": {
          "level": 2
        },
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Body"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Oval body, 9 cm long. Stuff firmly."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "attrs": {
          "level": 2
        },
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Arms (make 2)"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Capsule, 3.5 cm wide and 8 cm long. At the paw end, work 4 "
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "marks": [
              {
                "type": "glossaryTooltip",
                "attrs": {
                  "termSlug": "chain-claws-a78"
                }
              }
            ],
            "text": "chain claws"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " by chaining 5 and slip-stitching back to the last round, spacing evenly. Stuff lightly."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "attrs": {
          "level": 2
        },
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Legs (make 2)"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Capsule, 4 cm wide and 7 cm long. Work 3 chain claws at the foot end. Stuff lightly."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "attrs": {
          "level": 2
        },
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Ears (make 2)"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Cone, 3 cm base and 4 cm tall. Do not stuff. Sew flat to the top of the head."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "attrs": {
          "level": 2
        },
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Tail"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Capsule, 3 cm wide and 9 cm long. Stuff lightly. Brush the surface with a stiff-bristled brush for a fluffy texture."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "attrs": {
          "level": 2
        },
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Assembly"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Sew the head to the top of the body. Attach the arms to the upper sides of the body. Sew the legs to the base so the werewolf stands or sits. Pin the ears to the top of the head and sew flat. Attach the tail to the back of the body."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "attrs": {
          "level": 2
        },
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Finishing"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Use the "
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "marks": [
              {
                "type": "glossaryTooltip",
                "attrs": {
                  "termSlug": "invisible-decrease-a78"
                }
              }
            ],
            "text": "invisible decrease"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " throughout. Weave in all ends. Embroider fur-line marks in a darker brown thread along the chest if desired."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "attrs": {
          "level": 2
        },
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Materials needed"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
